- `scripts/error-path-scan.sh`, `scripts/secret-scan-diff.js` — mode-only changes, no content diff; confirmed via grep that no current caller depends on the executable bit, so this is functionally inert for every wired invocation today; both files carry proper shebangs (`#!/usr/bin/env bash`, `#!/usr/bin/env node` respectively) consistent with making them directly executable.
- No hardcoded secrets, no SQL/command/path-traversal injection surface introduced anywhere in this 3-file diff.
